              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, thrusting spear, shield. May have light armour (+2 pts), javelins (+1 pt). Combined Formation: may be combined with an Andalusian Archers unit (the archers lose Light Troops). (El Cid p.41)</characteristic>
