              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Bow, hand weapon. May have shields or light armour (+1 pt). Light Troops (Light Infantry). Combined Formation: may be combined with an Andalusian Spearmen unit (they lose the Light Troops ability). (El Cid p.42)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
