              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crossbow, sword. May have shield (+1 pt) and/or light armour (+2 pts). Light Infantry. Taifa Kings: only a single unit (0-1). Not available in the Caliphate of Cordoba. (El Cid p.42)</characteristic>
